# Design

- Follow [docs/design-system.md](docs/design-system.md) and [docs/screens.md](docs/screens.md). Tokens live in [docs/design/tokens.css](docs/design/tokens.css).
- Look: ink `#0E1114`, paper text `#E8E4DC`, **one** brass accent `#C4A574`. Dark-only in v1.
- shadcn/ui + Tailwind only. Map CSS variables to these tokens; do not leave default violet shadcn theme.
- Radius 8px controls, 10px cards max. 1px `--border`.
- Body 13px. Logs and 6-digit codes: `--font-mono`.
- Lucide 16px. No emoji, mascots, 3D icons, mesh gradients, purple AI chrome, glass blobs.
- Match the character of `docs/design/cherry-login.png`, `cherry-studio.png`, `cherry-llm-admin.png`.
- Real Turkish copy. Empty / loading / error on every screen.
- Desktop shell: sidebar + titlebar + statusbar. No mobile tab bar for Cherry.
